<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35311" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδῠναστεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to have power</i> or <i>exercise dominion in</i> or
				<i>among,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τισί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					691
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά τισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					516d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἐν τῷ σώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VM</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				3.28
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Eus.Mynd.
				39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>procure by one's authority</i> or <i>influence,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδυναστεύει Ἐπαμεινώνδας ὥστε μὴ
					φυγαδεῦσαι τοὺς κρατίστους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					7.1.42
				</span></i>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδυνέω</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδύνω</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδύω.</span>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
